{"id":"vod_md_4541","vodId":"4541","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"命运/新章 最终回响","name_cn":"命运/新章 最终回响","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230909-1/9ea081dbd1cdc39db99f75705ad49e1e.jpg"},"summary":"在本作舞台的2030年代世界中，被称为“西欧财阀”的巨大组织利用财力、武力进行世界规模的彻底性资源管理，所以技术以及人类的进步正停滞不前。因此表面上技术从2000年代起就没有改变。 此作的世界观与TYPE-MOON多作共通的世界观基本设定一致，但却是从TYPE-MOON多作共通世界观的1970年代派生出来的平行世界，而并不单纯是月姬和Fate等作品的未来。 在这个世界中大源的魔力(Mana)已经枯竭了。因此TYPE-MOON多作共通的世界观中的“魔术(Magi)”和“魔术师(Magus)”几乎都衰落了，魔术协会也只余下本来就不太依赖魔力的“阿特拉斯院”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-09 08:05:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/d7lW94Wk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/qjZLEbLB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/H346xLzO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/kYMQGkKo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/jW2YAedI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Ee4Eb1Ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/iLc7CtsS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/C7clrdZp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/xezx4rj3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/brjnLnEs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/pOxLl4cE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/BtHXtJfY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/5pb1uu2N/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:28.191Z"}